          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.528,
            0.646,
            0.804,
            0.762
          ],
          "content": "Sheetal marked two points on a piece of paper. How many different lines can she draw that pass through both of the points?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
